{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Bonafide Bone","id":"467139287192829977","is_bot":0,"username":".bonafidebone"},"author_id":"467139287192829977","channel_id":"863490802206507058","content":"The Paper reads\n\nEmpire City is not what it seems the redcoats have taken to the streets and show their military might, but if you listen carefully and keep your I eye on what lies in wait you will find we the patriots of empire city outnumber them 5 to 1 in strength. Do not expect those who fight to liberate you, you must fight, sit not ideally by while a red coat commits highway robbery upon your fellow countrymen, only when we recognize their law do they win for then they have taken your freedom. Take to the nights and defend those who are being put subject to a king they never agreed to follow. Do not forget friends to a true Patriot, there is no curfew, there is no true king, there is only liberty justice and Hope. Join as a true patriot and be ready to take up arms.\n\nLast night as i walked the streets of Hampstead I found the usual suspect of a patriot being robbed blind by those imperial dogs and so much like expect of all those fighting for liberty i stepped in. together we took down those dogs my fellow man proving himself a true patriot one willing to take up arms and not just support our cause with words, don’t let the propaganda fool you, however, the redcoats were given 3 chance to disengage from their losing fight and chose instead to be beaten down by the true patriots of Arcania. Do what you know is right and you will be surprised to find those around you will soon do the same. Truth is the only path to liberty! And let Justice and mercy be equal!.","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:48:32.179000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T00:49:20.934000Z","id":"864307274020290571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Bonafide Bone","id":"467139287192829977","is_bot":0,"username":".bonafidebone"},"author_id":"467139287192829977","channel_id":"863490802206507058","content":"(The first part seems to have being written a while ago the second has being scrawled quickly as a recap of what happened)","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:49:08.122000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T00:49:37.690000Z","id":"864307424776028181","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
