{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863490802206507058","content":"Luard quickly skims through the paper and pockets it before turning towards Eldon. \"This is enough information from you and I am grateful.\" He bows his head. \"For my last question, do you know where I can meet the half-orc, Johnathan Wrask, you fought with? Is he also with the patriots?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:52:22.246000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864308238991884318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
